error[E0277]: `BTreeMap<std::string::String, std::string::String>` cannot be flattened into another object
 --> tests/ui/traits/flatten.rs:7:22
  |
7 |     is_flattenable::<std::collections::BTreeMap<String, String>>();
  |                      ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ does not name its members
  |
  = help: the trait `kynos::schema::Flatten` is not implemented for `BTreeMap<std::string::String, std::string::String>`
  = note: a flattened field's members become the parent's own, so its schema has to name them; a map names none, so its values would reach the properties the object declared itself
  = note: give it a named field of its own, or add `#[schema(open)]` beside `#[serde(flatten)]` to say the object really is open -- the values then become the object's `unevaluatedProperties`
help: the following other types implement trait `kynos::schema::Flatten`
